# An application keeps the data of the object being copied.
#
#   ⟦ a ↦ ⟦ x ↦ ∅, Δ ⤍ 00-00-00-00-00-00-00-2A ⟧, foo ↦ Φ.a(x ↦ ⟦ Δ ⤍ 00-00-00-00-00-00-00-07 ⟧) ⟧
#
# The script below is printed by `phino sodg` 0.0.167.

F c0 a foo
F c1 x
Δ c1 00-00-00-00-00-00-00-2A
P c0 a c1
D c2 c0 a
F c3
Δ c3 00-00-00-00-00-00-00-07
A c4 c2 x c3
P c0 foo c4
